{"code":0,"data":{"title":"云真机调试服务介绍","content":"<p>无需购机，支持快速接入vivo主流机型。</p><p>实时手机屏幕显示，直观查看所有远程操作。同时提供日志分析和截图，真实复现bug。</p><h1 id=\"s-svgwchtk\"><br>一、使用指南</h1><h2 id=\"s-5pmnu22i\">1、选择设备</h2><p>在顶部导航【分发】-【应用分发】-点击【<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/vcl/#/remote/device/list\">云真机</a>】，或前往管理中心-【应用分发】-点击【<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/vcl/#/remote/device/list\">云真机</a>】，跳转到测试服务页面。</p><p>选择设备，然后远程操作测试。</p><h2 id=\"s-rvv4xxhz\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250507/mf6wi9/20250507190057934022.png\" data-natural-width=\"1904\" data-natural-height=\"298\" data-type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250507/7prtvq/20250507190758077158.png\" data-natural-width=\"1906\" data-natural-height=\"783\" data-type=\"image\"><br><br>2、远程测试<br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20240402/pypk2z/20240402114919450128.png\" data-natural-width=\"1882\" data-natural-height=\"889\" data-type=\"image\"></h2><h1 id=\"s-klcrh1ha\"><br>二、FAQ</h1><h3 id=\"s-tols6n7t\">Q1、使用云真机测试有什么限制？</h3><p>云真机每天最多使用6小时，可在测试页面查看剩余时长。</p><h3 id=\"s-jqmt4pef\"><br>Q2、云真机问题如何反馈？</h3><p>在云真机调试页面中，点击右上角功能按钮【故障反馈】。<br><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20230801/909fgq/20230801110130788027.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"776\" data-natural-width=\"802\" data-natural-height=\"889\" data-type=\"image\"><br></p>","versionCode":6,"updateTime":1746617020000,"breadCrumbs":"云测服务,云真机调试服务介绍","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}